      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1961, the official presidential aircraft, known as Air Force One when the president is aboard, was stationed at Andrews, making it the president's home base.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18,
        19,
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
