      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Andrews merged with Naval Air Facility Washington in 2009 to form Joint Base Andrews, the first joint base in the U.S. military.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
